<title>POLAND: COMPUTERLAND JULY NET DOWN TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>COMPUTERLAND JULY NET DOWN TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.48 vs   0.66</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.73 vs   1.07</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.54 vs   1.43</p>
<p> Sales		   13.81 vs  11.92</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     5.13 vs   5.50</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 7.61 vs   8.92</p>
<p> Operating profit     6.22 vs   8.31</p>
<p> Sales		   91.82 vs  84.40</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish computer firm is ComputerLand</p>
<p>Poland SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
